      "sentence": "Hardware watchdog timer for the Teknic ClearCore (Microchip SAME53N19A).",
      "paragraph": "Direct CMSIS register access to the SAMD51/SAME53 WDT block. Teknic's ClearCore Arduino library does not expose any watchdog API; this fills the gap. Bench-validated on a real ClearCore — deliberate-hang test confirms automatic reset within the configured timeout, bracketed long operations do not trigger spurious resets. Configurable timeouts from 1s to 16s (default 8s), Always-On mode, early-warning callback, reset-cause introspection via RSTC.RCAUSE.",
